<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa cargo '96 factor up at 69.2pct.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa cargo '96 factor up at 69.2pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The load factor of Lufthansa Cargo AG rose 0.2 percentage points to 69.2 percent in 1996, the Deutsche Lufthansa AG investor relations department said.</p>
<p>The following table shows Lufthansa Cargo traffic for January-December 1996.</p>
<p>    Cargo/mail (1,000 tonnes)	1,671.0  up 3.3 pct</p>
<p>    Available cargo tonne-km (mln) 9,318    up 3.1 pct</p>
<p>    Revenue cargo tonne-km (mln)   6,448    up 3.4 pct</p>
<p>    Cargo load factor		  69.2     up 0.2 pct points</p>
<p>    Americas (1,000 t)		 439.9    up 4.3 pct</p>
<p>    Asia-Pacific (1,000 t)	   424.2    up 5.8 pct</p>
<p>    Europe (1,000 t)		   761.1    up 1.4 pct</p>
<p>-- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
